      "Elevated urinary aspartylglucosamine levels"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Skeletal X-rays showing dysostosis multiplex",
      "Brain MRI may show cerebral atrophy in advanced stages"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Pathogenic variants in the AGA gene on chromosome 4q34"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Coarse facial features and connective tissue abnormalities on clinical examination"
    ]
